{"seq":5,"slug":"materials-chemistry","title":"材料化学","stage":"DONE","category":"chemistry","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry","rating":{"composite":3.77,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"材料化学\">材料化学</h1><p>材料化学（Materials Chemistry）是化学与材料科学的交叉学科，研究材料的化学组成、微观结构、合成方法与宏观性能之间的内在关联。它以化学键理论、热力学和动力学为基础，通过分子设计和化学合成手段创造具有特定功能的新材料，是现代科技发展的核心驱动力之一。</p>\n<p>本知识库涵盖材料化学的四个核心方向：高分子材料化学探讨聚合反应机理与功能高分子设计；纳米材料化学关注纳米尺度材料的独特性质与合成策略；无机材料化学涉及晶体结构、陶瓷、玻璃和半导体材料；能源材料化学聚焦电池、光伏和氢能等清洁能源技术中的关键材料问题。这四个方向相互交织，共同推动着从电子信息、新能源到生物医学等领域的技术革新。</p>\n<p>材料化学的学习需要扎实的化学基础，包括无机化学、有机化学、物理化学和结构化学的核心概念。本知识库假定读者具备本科化学基础，在此之上系统地展开各类材料的化学本质和前沿进展。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"polymers","title":"高分子材料化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/polymers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"polymerization-mechanisms","title":"聚合反应机理（Polymerization Mechanisms）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/polymers/polymerization-mechanisms"},{"seq":2,"slug":"polymer-properties","title":"聚合物结构-性能关系（Polymer Structure-Property Relationships）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/polymers/polymer-properties"},{"seq":3,"slug":"functional-polymers","title":"功能高分子材料（Functional Polymers）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/polymers/functional-polymers"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"nanomaterials","title":"纳米材料化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/nanomaterials","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synthesis-methods","title":"纳米材料合成方法（Nanomaterial Synthesis Methods）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/nanomaterials/synthesis-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"characterization-techniques","title":"纳米表征技术（Characterization Techniques for Nanomaterials）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/nanomaterials/characterization-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"applications-nanotech","title":"纳米技术应用（Applications of Nanotechnology）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/nanomaterials/applications-nanotech"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"inorganic-materials","title":"无机材料化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crystal-structure-defects","title":"晶体结构与缺陷（Crystal Structure and Defects）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials/crystal-structure-defects"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ceramics-glasses","title":"陶瓷与玻璃材料（Ceramics and Glasses）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials/ceramics-glasses"},{"seq":3,"slug":"semiconductor-materials","title":"半导体材料化学（Semiconductor Materials Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/inorganic-materials/semiconductor-materials"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"energy-materials","title":"能源材料化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"battery-materials","title":"电池材料化学（Battery Materials Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/battery-materials"},{"seq":2,"slug":"photovoltaic-materials","title":"光伏材料（Photovoltaic Materials）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/photovoltaic-materials"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hydrogen-fuel-cell","title":"氢能与燃料电池材料（Hydrogen and Fuel Cell Materials）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/materials-chemistry/energy-materials/hydrogen-fuel-cell"}]}]}